---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Layout
  title="Car AC Service - Taqwa Automobile Service Center"
  description="Professional car AC service and repair in Uttara, Dhaka. Gas refill, leak detection, compressor repair, and full AC diagnostics at Taqwa Automobile Service Center."
  path="car-ac-service.html"
  current="services"
>

<style define:vars={{ heroBg: `url(${base}img/hero-background.jpg)` }}>
  /* Everything shared with the rest of the site (tokens, reset, header,
     mobile nav, buttons/eyebrow, footer, why-choose, our-environment,
     our-features, our-latest-news, services-recap section, hybrid service
     process, the about-style CTA banner, and the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item/.hybrid-illustration selectors) now lives in
     src/styles/global.css. The "car wash", "our services", "our
     environment/features", "story", "stats" and "team" blocks that used to
     be duplicated here were dead CSS — this page never renders those
     sections — and have been dropped. Only the declarations genuinely
     specific to this page remain below. */

  /* Hero image needs the base-path-aware URL (global.css's .hero can't use
     Astro's define:vars); this page's hero paragraph is also a dimmer
     "muted" gray rather than global.css's near-white default. */
  .hero{
    background:
      linear-gradient(rgba(16,19,24,0.65), rgba(16,19,24,0.75)),
      var(--heroBg) center/cover no-repeat;
  }
  .hero-copy p{color:var(--muted);}

  /* This page's header collapses to the hamburger menu at 980px, not
     global.css's default 1024px — restore the full nav in that gap. */
  @media (min-width:981px) and (max-width:1024px){
    nav.main-nav > ul{display:flex;}
    .hamburger{display:none;}
    .call-btn{display:flex;}
  }

  /* This page's hybrid-section reuses the shared .hybrid-content/
     .svc-reason-item pattern with its own background-glow position and a
     wider hybrid-grid/hybrid-features-strip than the homepage's default. */
  .hybrid-panel::before{mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 70% at 75% 50%, black, transparent);}
  .hybrid-grid{gap:26px 22px;}
  .hybrid-features-strip{grid-template-columns:repeat(6, 1fr);}

  /* This page's FAQ accordion uses a snappier, non-eased transition than the
     smoother default in global.css — preserved exactly as before. */
  .faq-question{transition:none;}
  .faq-question .faq-arrow::before, .faq-question .faq-arrow::after{
    transition:transform .25s ease, opacity .25s ease;
  }
  .faq-answer{transition:max-height .3s ease;}

  /* This page's inner-page banner uses a real photo background instead of
     global.css's default subtle grid-texture, plus its own fixed sizing. */
  .page-banner{
    background:linear-gradient(150deg, #18263A 0%, #0A0F17 100%);
    padding:68px 32px 58px;
  }
  .page-banner::before{
    background-image:url("img/background-2.jpg");
    background-size:cover; background-position:center; background-repeat:no-repeat;
    mask-image:none;
  }
  .page-banner h1{font-size:44px;}
  @media (max-width:760px){
    .page-banner{padding:44px 20px 40px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:30px;}
  }
  @media (max-width:420px){
    .page-banner{padding:36px 16px 32px;}
    .page-banner h1{font-size:25px;}
  }
</style>


<section class="page-banner">
  <div class="page-banner-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow">STAY COOL ALL YEAR</div>
    <h1 class="display">CAR AC <span class="accent">SERVICE</span></h1>
    <p style="color:var(--off); font-size:16px; line-height:1.75; max-width:620px; margin:0 auto 20px;">Full AC diagnostics, gas refill and repair to keep your car cool, whatever the weather — done right the first time.</p>
    <div class="breadcrumb">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <span class="sep">»</span>
      <span class="current">Car AC Service</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-section" style="padding-top:56px;">
  <div class="hybrid-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-panel">

      <div class="hybrid-header">
        <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">COLD AIR, EVERY TIME <span class="accent">YOU TURN THE KEY</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-content">
        <div class="story-content" style="position:relative;">
          <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px;">Weak airflow, warm air, strange smells or noises from the vents — car AC problems are easy to ignore until the heat makes them impossible to. At Taqwa Automobile, we properly diagnose your AC system before recommending any repair, so you know exactly what's wrong and what it will cost.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);">From a simple gas refill to compressor replacement, our technicians handle it all with genuine refrigerant, proper leak detection equipment, and a careful process that keeps your cooling system reliable long after you leave.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="hybrid-illustration">
          <img src={base + "img/Car-ac-Service.jpg"} alt="Car AC service and repair at Taqwa Automobile" style="width:100%; height:auto; border-radius:6px;">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hybrid-grid" style="margin-top:30px; padding-top:28px; border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); position:relative;">

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Full Leak Detection</h4>
            <p>We trace the exact source of gas loss instead of just refilling and hoping the problem doesn't come back.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="7" width="15" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4"/><rect x="18" y="10" width="2" height="4" fill="#F97316"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Genuine Refrigerant &amp; Parts</h4>
            <p>Only correct-grade refrigerant and manufacturer-approved parts, protecting your compressor and system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l7 3v6c0 4.5-3 8-7 9-4-1-7-4.5-7-9V5l7-3z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Experienced AC Technicians</h4>
            <p>Our team is trained on modern and older AC systems alike, including hybrid and CNG-converted vehicles.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="svc-reason-item">
          <div class="svc-reason-num"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div>
          <div>
            <h4>Fast, Reliable Cooling</h4>
            <p>Most AC services are completed the same day, so you're back on the road with cold air, fast.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-features-strip">
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Certified AC Technicians</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Genuine Refrigerant</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Leak Detection Equipment</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Warranty on Service</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>No Hidden Charges</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hf-item">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" fill="#F97316"/><path d="M8 12.5l2.5 2.5L16 9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        <span>Quick Same-Day Turnaround</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<section class="hybrid-process-section">
  <div class="hybrid-process-inner">
    <div class="hybrid-process-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR AC <span class="accent">SERVICE PROCESS</span></h2>
      <p>From the first performance check to the final cooling test, every AC service at Taqwa Automobile follows the same careful process.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hybrid-process-steps">

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">01</div>
        <h3>AC Performance Check</h3>
        <p>We check cooling output, airflow and cabin temperature to understand exactly how your AC is performing.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">02</div>
        <h3>Refrigerant &amp; Pressure Test</h3>
        <p>We measure refrigerant levels and system pressure to identify gas loss or component issues.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">03</div>
        <h3>Leak Detection</h3>
        <p>If gas is low, we trace the exact leak point instead of just topping it up temporarily.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">04</div>
        <h3>Component Repair or Replacement</h3>
        <p>Compressor, condenser, evaporator or other parts are repaired or replaced using genuine components.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">05</div>
        <h3>Re-Gas &amp; Cooling Test</h3>
        <p>The system is recharged with the correct refrigerant and tested to confirm strong, cold airflow.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hp-item">
        <div class="hp-num">06</div>
        <h3>Warranty &amp; Follow-Up</h3>
        <p>We back our AC work with a service warranty and are here if you notice any issues afterward.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-recap-section">
  <div class="services-recap-inner">
    <div class="services-recap-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">OUR <span class="accent">CAR AC SERVICES</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="services-grid">

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 12l2 2 4-5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>AC Gas Refill (Re-gas)</h3>
          <p>Precise refrigerant top-up or full recharge to restore strong, cold airflow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="8" width="16" height="10" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><circle cx="12" cy="13" r="2.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Compressor Repair &amp; Replacement</h3>
          <p>Diagnosis and repair of noisy, seized or failing AC compressors, the heart of your cooling system.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12h4l2-5 4 10 2-5h6" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Condenser &amp; Evaporator Service</h3>
          <p>Cleaning, repair or replacement of condenser and evaporator coils for efficient heat exchange.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="14.5" y1="14.5" x2="20" y2="20" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M7 10h1.5l1-2 1.5 4 1-2H13" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>AC Leak Detection &amp; Repair</h3>
          <p>Finding and fixing the exact source of refrigerant leaks so your cooling stays consistent.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="1.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><line x1="6" y1="10" x2="18" y2="10" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/><line x1="6" y1="14" x2="18" y2="14" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.2"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Cabin Filter Replacement</h3>
          <p>Fresh cabin air filters for cleaner air inside your car and better AC airflow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M12 8v4l3 2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Blower Motor Repair</h3>
          <p>Repair or replacement of blower motors for strong, consistent cabin airflow.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><line x1="10.5" y1="10.5" x2="13.5" y2="13.5" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>AC Belt &amp; Pulley Service</h3>
          <p>Inspection and replacement of worn belts and pulleys that drive your AC compressor.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="icon-panel">
          <svg width="56" height="56" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="3" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.4"/><path d="M8 8h8v8H8z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3"/><path d="M12 3v2M12 19v2M3 12h2M19 12h2" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Full AC System Diagnostics</h3>
          <p>Complete performance check covering pressure, temperature, airflow and every major component.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="why-choose-inner">

    <div class="why-choose-content">
      <div class="eyebrow-line">Why Trust Us</div>
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.3px;">With Your <span class="accent">Car AC Service</span>?</h2>
      <p>A quick gas top-up might feel like a fix, but it rarely lasts. Our workshop combines proper leak detection, genuine refrigerant and experienced technicians to solve the real problem, not just mask it.</p>
      <a href="#contact" class="btn-learn">
        Book Your AC Service
        <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="why-choose-grid">

      <div class="wc-card tech">
        <img src={base + "img/expert-technitian.jpg"} alt="Certified Car AC Technicians" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Certified AC Technicians</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card tools">
        <img src={base + "img/car-parts.jpg"} alt="Genuine Refrigerant and AC Parts" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Genuine Refrigerant &amp; Parts</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card parts">
        <img src={base + "img/Car-ac-Service.jpg"} alt="Advanced AC Leak Detection" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Advanced Leak Detection</div>
      </div>

      <div class="wc-card service">
        <img src={base + "img/Trusted-Service.jpg"} alt="Fast and Reliable AC Service" style="position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; z-index:0;">
        <div class="wc-label">Fast, Reliable Service</div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="display" style="letter-spacing:0.4px;">CAR AC SERVICE <span class="accent">FAQ</span></h2>
    </div>

    <div class="faq-grid">
      <div class="faq-column">

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Why is my car AC not cooling properly?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Weak cooling is usually caused by low refrigerant, a leak, a failing compressor, or a clogged condenser. We run a full diagnostic to pinpoint the exact cause before recommending a fix.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            How often should I service my car AC?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">We recommend a check-up at least once a year, or sooner if you notice weaker cooling, unusual smells, or strange noises from the AC system.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you handle AC gas leaks?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes. We use proper leak detection equipment to find the exact source of the leak and repair it, rather than just refilling gas that will leak out again.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Can hybrid or CNG vehicles get AC service here too?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Absolutely. Our technicians are experienced with AC systems in hybrid and CNG-converted vehicles as well as standard petrol and diesel cars.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-question">
            Do you offer warranty on AC repairs?
            <span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-answer">
            <div class="faq-answer-inner">Yes, our AC repairs and part replacements come with a service warranty. Ask our team for details specific to the work done on your vehicle.</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="about-cta-section" id="contact">
  <div class="about-cta-inner">
    <h2>Beat the Heat — Book Your AC Service Today</h2>
    <p>Book a full AC checkup or ask our specialists a question &mdash; call, message us on WhatsApp, or visit our workshop in Uttara.</p>
    <div class="about-cta-address">
      <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 21s7-6.5 7-11.5a7 7 0 10-14 0C5 14.5 12 21 12 21z" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="2.3" stroke="#F97316" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
      <span>Sector # 15, Block # C, Road # 3/A, Plot # 40, Diabari, Uttara, Dhaka.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="about-cta-actions">
      <a href="tel:+8801854226757" class="btn btn-red">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        Call Now
      </a>
      <a href="https://wa.me/8801854226757" class="btn btn-green">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M17.6 6.32A8.86 8.86 0 0012 4a8.94 8.94 0 00-7.75 13.4L3 21l3.7-1.23A8.94 8.94 0 0012 21a8.94 8.94 0 006.32-15.32z" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M9 8.5c.3-.6 1-1 1.6-.5.5.4.9 1.4.6 2-.3.6-1.1 1.1-.7 1.9.5.9 1.7 2.1 2.6 2.6.8.4 1.3-.4 1.9-.7.6-.3 1.6.1 2 .6.5.6.1 1.3-.5 1.6-1.2.6-2.7.4-4-.2-1.8-.8-3.4-2.4-4.2-4.2-.6-1.3-.8-2.8-.2-4z" fill="#fff"/></svg>
        WhatsApp Us
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


</Layout>
